From: Andrei Tanas <5031276+andreitanas@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:42:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Subaru: remember AVH and Auto Start Stop across restarts
 (2020-22 Outback/Legacy)

Learns the driver's choice from real button presses and restores it once the engine is running,
by sending copies of the car's own button messages on the alt bus. Panda safety allows only those
copies (exactly one AVH request, or the ASS button bit) on the alt bus, behind a new SP safety flag.
The panda firmware is rebuilt with the change.

